        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D05-K447, Ornate Victorian Latchset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Victorian Latchset features ornate detailing that makes it the fancy choice. It is available with a wide selection of either knobs or levers, some as ornate as the backplate, and some more austere to help quiet the piece down. Choose from a huge array of finishes, including oh-so-popular brass, nickel, and oil rubbed bronze. This Victorian Collection Latchset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside knob/lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. The finish for the knob or lever you choose will match the plate finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Victorian Latchset, Brass Accents D05-K447",
                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K447, Victorian Latchset - The Victorian Latchset features ornate detailing that makes it the fancy choice. It is available with a wide selection of either knobs or levers, some as ornate as the backplate, and some more austere to help quiet the piece down. Choose from a huge array of finishes, including oh-so-popular brass, nickel, and oil rubbed bronze. This Victorian Collection Latchset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
